[
  {
    "start": 0,
    "end": 0.9,
    "text": "You prepare to stop"
  },
  {
    "start": 0.9,
    "end": 2.58,
    "text": "Barcelona's wingers, and then"
  },
  {
    "start": 2.58,
    "end": 3.74,
    "text": "their most dangerous winger"
  },
  {
    "start": 3.74,
    "end": 4.8,
    "text": "turns up between your"
  },
  {
    "start": 4.8,
    "end": 5.34,
    "text": "centre backs."
  },
  {
    "start": 5.92,
    "end": 7.32,
    "text": "Against Sevilla, Raphinha"
  },
  {
    "start": 7.32,
    "end": 8.4,
    "text": "scored three times."
  },
  {
    "start": 8.68,
    "end": 9.52,
    "text": "A turn inside the"
  },
  {
    "start": 9.52,
    "end": 10.54,
    "text": "box, a header,"
  },
  {
    "start": 10.96,
    "end": 11.66,
    "text": "then a run behind"
  },
  {
    "start": 11.66,
    "end": 12.14,
    "text": "the defence."
  },
  {
    "start": 12.68,
    "end": 13.52,
    "text": "Three different problems."
  },
  {
    "start": 13.92,
    "end": 14.46,
    "text": "One player."
  },
  {
    "start": 14.92,
    "end": 15.8,
    "text": "Hansi Flick has moved"
  },
  {
    "start": 15.8,
    "end": 16.54,
    "text": "him into the middle,"
  },
  {
    "start": 16.82,
    "end": 18.1,
    "text": "and the consequences are"
  },
  {
    "start": 18.1,
    "end": 18.94,
    "text": "getting ridiculous."
  },
  {
    "start": 19.82,
    "end": 21.14,
    "text": "14 goals in eight"
  },
  {
    "start": 21.14,
    "end": 22.0,
    "text": "competitive games."
  },
  {
    "start": 22.48,
    "end": 23.26,
    "text": "But this is bigger"
  },
  {
    "start": 23.26,
    "end": 24.14,
    "text": "than a hot streak."
  },
  {
    "start": 24.5,
    "end": 25.08,
    "text": "It is about the"
  },
  {
    "start": 25.08,
    "end": 26.62,
    "text": "decision Barcelona now force"
  },
  {
    "start": 26.62,
    "end": 27.92,
    "text": "every defender to make."
  },
  {
    "start": 27.92,
    "end": 29.46,
    "text": "After the Sevilla game,"
  },
  {
    "start": 29.84,
    "end": 30.96,
    "text": "Shaka Hislop picked out"
  },
  {
    "start": 30.96,
    "end": 31.88,
    "text": "what makes this role"
  },
  {
    "start": 31.88,
    "end": 32.56,
    "text": "so difficult."
  },
  {
    "start": 95.72,
    "end": 96.64,
    "text": "The important word here"
  },
  {
    "start": 96.64,
    "end": 97.16,
    "text": "is"
  },
  {
    "start": 97.16,
    "end": 98.76,
    "text": "movement."
  },
  {
    "start": 99.84,
    "end": 100.76,
    "text": "Playing centrally does not"
  },
  {
    "start": 100.76,
    "end": 101.84,
    "text": "mean Raphinha has to"
  },
  {
    "start": 101.84,
    "end": 102.96,
    "text": "stand still and wrestle"
  },
  {
    "start": 102.96,
    "end": 103.86,
    "text": "with two center backs"
  },
  {
    "start": 103.86,
    "end": 104.76,
    "text": "for 90 minutes."
  },
  {
    "start": 105.3,
    "end": 105.88,
    "text": "It gives him a"
  },
  {
    "start": 105.88,
    "end": 106.96,
    "text": "starting point from which"
  },
  {
    "start": 106.96,
    "end": 107.92,
    "text": "he can ask different"
  },
  {
    "start": 107.92,
    "end": 108.4,
    "text": "questions."
  },
  {
    "start": 109.12,
    "end": 110.1,
    "text": "Come towards the ball,"
  },
  {
    "start": 110.6,
    "end": 111.36,
    "text": "pin a defender for"
  },
  {
    "start": 111.36,
    "end": 112.54,
    "text": "a moment, then disappear"
  },
  {
    "start": 112.54,
    "end": 113.24,
    "text": "behind his shoulder."
  },
  {
    "start": 113.92,
    "end": 115.2,
    "text": "Those movements draw on"
  },
  {
    "start": 115.2,
    "end": 115.88,
    "text": "his experience of"
  },
  {
    "start": 115.88,
    "end": 116.98,
    "text": "understanding the game from"
  },
  {
    "start": 116.98,
    "end": 117.74,
    "text": "wide areas."
  },
  {
    "start": 118.28,
    "end": 119.02,
    "text": "He can recognize the"
  },
  {
    "start": 119.02,
    "end": 119.96,
    "text": "moment a defender turns"
  },
  {
    "start": 119.96,
    "end": 120.82,
    "text": "to look at the ball."
  },
  {
    "start": 121.34,
    "end": 121.96,
    "text": "That is the moment"
  },
  {
    "start": 121.96,
    "end": 122.78,
    "text": "a run can begin."
  },
  {
    "start": 123.44,
    "end": 124.3,
    "text": "Think about the difference."
  },
  {
    "start": 125.22,
    "end": 125.7,
    "text": "Out wide,"
  },
  {
    "start": 126.22,
    "end": 127.26,
    "text": "an attacker often has"
  },
  {
    "start": 127.26,
    "end": 127.98,
    "text": "to beat the defender"
  },
  {
    "start": 127.98,
    "end": 128.58,
    "text": "in front of him"
  },
  {
    "start": 128.58,
    "end": 129.38,
    "text": "before he can threaten"
  },
  {
    "start": 129.38,
    "end": 129.74,
    "text": "the goal."
  },
  {
    "start": 130.34,
    "end": 130.94,
    "text": "Through the middle,"
  },
  {
    "start": 131.38,
    "end": 132.36,
    "text": "one well -timed movement"
  },
  {
    "start": 132.36,
    "end": 133.14,
    "text": "can put him on"
  },
  {
    "start": 133.14,
    "end": 133.78,
    "text": "the other side of"
  },
  {
    "start": 133.78,
    "end": 134.62,
    "text": "the entire line."
  },
  {
    "start": 135.62,
    "end": 136.42,
    "text": "Flick has not discovered"
  },
  {
    "start": 136.42,
    "end": 137.42,
    "text": "that Raphinha is a"
  },
  {
    "start": 137.42,
    "end": 138.04,
    "text": "good footballer."
  },
  {
    "start": 138.38,
    "end": 139.28,
    "text": "We already knew that."
  },
  {
    "start": 139.42,
    "end": 140.22,
    "text": "He is changing where"
  },
  {
    "start": 140.22,
    "end": 141.38,
    "text": "those qualities hurt you."
  },
  {
    "start": 141.38,
    "end": 142.96,
    "text": "And that distinction matters,"
  },
  {
    "start": 143.1,
    "end": 144.16,
    "text": "this is a mobile"
  },
  {
    "start": 144.16,
    "end": 146.06,
    "text": "central forward, not a"
  },
  {
    "start": 146.06,
    "end": 146.86,
    "text": "tactical label that explains"
  },
  {
    "start": 146.86,
    "end": 148.12,
    "text": "itself, watch what he"
  },
  {
    "start": 148.12,
    "end": 149.12,
    "text": "does after taking up"
  },
  {
    "start": 149.12,
    "end": 149.6,
    "text": "the position."
  },
  {
    "start": 150.22,
    "end": 151.24,
    "text": "Imagine you are the"
  },
  {
    "start": 151.24,
    "end": 152.68,
    "text": "center back, Raphinha comes"
  },
  {
    "start": 152.68,
    "end": 154.12,
    "text": "short, follow him, and"
  },
  {
    "start": 154.12,
    "end": 154.66,
    "text": "you may open a"
  },
  {
    "start": 154.66,
    "end": 155.9,
    "text": "channel behind you, hold"
  },
  {
    "start": 155.9,
    "end": 156.94,
    "text": "your position, and he"
  },
  {
    "start": 156.94,
    "end": 157.9,
    "text": "may receive with enough"
  },
  {
    "start": 157.9,
    "end": 159.04,
    "text": "room to connect the attack."
  },
  {
    "start": 159.58,
    "end": 160.46,
    "text": "Neither decision is"
  },
  {
    "start": 160.46,
    "end": 161.32,
    "text": "automatically wrong."
  },
  {
    "start": 161.74,
    "end": 162.66,
    "text": "The problem is making"
  },
  {
    "start": 162.66,
    "end": 163.74,
    "text": "it, while other players"
  },
  {
    "start": 163.74,
    "end": 164.74,
    "text": "are moving around you."
  },
  {
    "start": 165.08,
    "end": 166.16,
    "text": "Now put Lamine Yamal on"
  },
  {
    "start": 166.16,
    "end": 166.48,
    "text": "the right."
  },
  {
    "start": 167.14,
    "end": 168.04,
    "text": "If your team sends"
  },
  {
    "start": 168.04,
    "end": 169.26,
    "text": "another defender towards him,"
  },
  {
    "start": 169.48,
    "end": 170.64,
    "text": "an inside space can open."
  },
  {
    "start": 171.46,
    "end": 172.58,
    "text": "Raphinha can attack that"
  },
  {
    "start": 172.58,
    "end": 173.66,
    "text": "space before the defense"
  },
  {
    "start": 173.66,
    "end": 174.84,
    "text": "reconnects."
  },
  {
    "start": 174.84,
    "end": 175.58,
    "text": "If you protect the"
  },
  {
    "start": 175.58,
    "end": 176.24,
    "text": "middle instead,"
  },
  {
    "start": 176.68,
    "end": 177.64,
    "text": "Yamal gets more freedom"
  },
  {
    "start": 177.64,
    "end": 178.66,
    "text": "to choose the delivery."
  },
  {
    "start": 179.18,
    "end": 180.16,
    "text": "Barcelona do not need"
  },
  {
    "start": 180.16,
    "end": 181.42,
    "text": "the same pass every time."
  },
  {
    "start": 181.96,
    "end": 182.64,
    "text": "Pedri can find the"
  },
  {
    "start": 182.64,
    "end": 183.4,
    "text": "run from midfield,"
  },
  {
    "start": 183.94,
    "end": 184.82,
    "text": "Yamal can release it"
  },
  {
    "start": 184.82,
    "end": 185.38,
    "text": "from the flank."
  },
  {
    "start": 185.78,
    "end": 187.02,
    "text": "A combination can change"
  },
  {
    "start": 187.02,
    "end": 188.22,
    "text": "the angle just as"
  },
  {
    "start": 188.22,
    "end": 189.16,
    "text": "the defender thinks he"
  },
  {
    "start": 189.16,
    "end": 189.92,
    "text": "has closed the lane."
  },
  {
    "start": 190.34,
    "end": 190.92,
    "text": "That is why the"
  },
  {
    "start": 190.92,
    "end": 192.26,
    "text": "partnership matters more than"
  },
  {
    "start": 192.26,
    "end": 193.2,
    "text": "the formation on the"
  },
  {
    "start": 193.2,
    "end": 193.6,
    "text": "team sheet."
  },
  {
    "start": 193.84,
    "end": 194.7,
    "text": "The runner needs someone"
  },
  {
    "start": 194.7,
    "end": 195.82,
    "text": "who sees him, the"
  },
  {
    "start": 195.82,
    "end": 196.84,
    "text": "passer needs someone who"
  },
  {
    "start": 196.84,
    "end": 198.26,
    "text": "moves before the opening"
  },
  {
    "start": 198.26,
    "end": 199.1,
    "text": "becomes obvious."
  },
  {
    "start": 199.86,
    "end": 200.76,
    "text": "When those two decisions"
  },
  {
    "start": 200.76,
    "end": 202.3,
    "text": "happen together, a tiny"
  },
  {
    "start": 202.3,
    "end": 203.34,
    "text": "gap becomes a clear"
  },
  {
    "start": 203.34,
    "end": 203.78,
    "text": "chance."
  },
  {
    "start": 204.7,
    "end": 205.66,
    "text": "Earlier in September,"
  },
  {
    "start": 206.2,
    "end": 207.46,
    "text": "Alejandro Moreno had already"
  },
  {
    "start": 207.46,
    "end": 208.72,
    "text": "spotted the same problem."
  },
  {
    "start": 209.02,
    "end": 209.15885500000002,
    "text": "But"
  },
  {
    "start": 265.4,
    "end": 266.24,
    "text": "gave us the clearest"
  },
  {
    "start": 266.24,
    "end": 267.78,
    "text": "demonstration and it started"
  },
  {
    "start": 267.78,
    "end": 269.06,
    "text": "with Barcelona in trouble"
  },
  {
    "start": 269.06,
    "end": 270.5,
    "text": "The home side scored"
  },
  {
    "start": 270.5,
    "end": 271.84,
    "text": "first their pressure"
  },
  {
    "start": 271.84,
    "end": 273.5,
    "text": "disrupted Barcelona and the"
  },
  {
    "start": 273.5,
    "end": 274.32,
    "text": "opening half was a"
  },
  {
    "start": 274.32,
    "end": 275.92,
    "text": "contest Then Raphinha"
  },
  {
    "start": 275.92,
    "end": 277.32,
    "text": "answered from inside the"
  },
  {
    "start": 277.32,
    "end": 278.98,
    "text": "penalty area Kristensen"
  },
  {
    "start": 278.98,
    "end": 280.26,
    "text": "found him, he escaped"
  },
  {
    "start": 280.26,
    "end": 281.18,
    "text": "his marker with a"
  },
  {
    "start": 281.18,
    "end": 281.78,
    "text": "clever turn,"
  },
  {
    "start": 282.32,
    "end": 282.78,
    "text": "and finished."
  },
  {
    "start": 283.34,
    "end": 284.14,
    "text": "That is one version"
  },
  {
    "start": 284.14,
    "end": 285.1,
    "text": "of the central role."
  },
  {
    "start": 285.62,
    "end": 286.88,
    "text": "Receive under pressure and"
  },
  {
    "start": 286.88,
    "end": 287.82,
    "text": "create the shooting angle"
  },
  {
    "start": 287.82,
    "end": 288.26,
    "text": "yourself."
  },
  {
    "start": 289.42,
    "end": 290.44,
    "text": "After the break came"
  },
  {
    "start": 290.44,
    "end": 291.24,
    "text": "a different answer."
  },
  {
    "start": 291.82,
    "end": 292.5,
    "text": "Yamal delivered,"
  },
  {
    "start": 292.98,
    "end": 293.86,
    "text": "and Raphinha got to"
  },
  {
    "start": 293.86,
    "end": 294.8,
    "text": "the cross ahead of"
  },
  {
    "start": 294.8,
    "end": 295.88,
    "text": "the defender to head"
  },
  {
    "start": 295.88,
    "end": 296.98,
    "text": "Barcelona in front."
  },
  {
    "start": 297.56,
    "end": 298.86,
    "text": "This time the decisive"
  },
  {
    "start": 298.86,
    "end": 300.06,
    "text": "skill was arriving at"
  },
  {
    "start": 300.06,
    "end": 301.2,
    "text": "the destination first."
  },
  {
    "start": 301.76,
    "end": 302.34,
    "text": "For the third,"
  },
  {
    "start": 302.82,
    "end": 303.96,
    "text": "the attack moved through"
  },
  {
    "start": 303.96,
    "end": 305.0,
    "text": "Rodri to Yamal."
  },
  {
    "start": 305.5,
    "end": 307.36,
    "text": "Raphinha ran beyond, received"
  },
  {
    "start": 307.36,
    "end": 308.5,
    "text": "the through ball and"
  },
  {
    "start": 308.5,
    "end": 309.4,
    "text": "lifted the finish."
  },
  {
    "start": 310.38,
    "end": 311.84,
    "text": "Receive and turn, attack"
  },
  {
    "start": 311.84,
    "end": 313.42,
    "text": "the delivery, run behind."
  },
  {
    "start": 314.38,
    "end": 315.02,
    "text": "It is tempting to"
  },
  {
    "start": 315.02,
    "end": 316.14,
    "text": "describe all three as"
  },
  {
    "start": 316.14,
    "end": 317.02,
    "text": "simply putting a winger"
  },
  {
    "start": 317.02,
    "end": 317.78,
    "text": "up front,"
  },
  {
    "start": 318.22,
    "end": 319.22,
    "text": "but that misses the"
  },
  {
    "start": 319.22,
    "end": 319.6,
    "text": "variety."
  },
  {
    "start": 320.18,
    "end": 321.12,
    "text": "The defender has to"
  },
  {
    "start": 321.12,
    "end": 322.04,
    "text": "solve a different problem"
  },
  {
    "start": 322.04,
    "end": 323.54,
    "text": "each time, and Raphinha"
  },
  {
    "start": 323.54,
    "end": 324.38,
    "text": "does not need to"
  },
  {
    "start": 324.38,
    "end": 325.68,
    "text": "dominate every second of"
  },
  {
    "start": 325.68,
    "end": 327.06,
    "text": "the match to decide it."
  },
  {
    "start": 327.26,
    "end": 328.14,
    "text": "He needs to recognize"
  },
  {
    "start": 328.14,
    "end": 329.3,
    "text": "the seconds that matter."
  },
  {
    "start": 329.74,
    "end": 331.04,
    "text": "After that win, Barcelona"
  },
  {
    "start": 331.04,
    "end": 332.48,
    "text": "had taken all 21"
  },
  {
    "start": 332.48,
    "end": 334.14,
    "text": "available league points, 31"
  },
  {
    "start": 334.14,
    "end": 335.6,
    "text": "goals in seven games."
  },
  {
    "start": 336.1,
    "end": 337.52,
    "text": "Raphinha had 12 of them."
  },
  {
    "start": 338.02,
    "end": 338.84,
    "text": "That is an extraordinary"
  },
  {
    "start": 338.84,
    "end": 340.06,
    "text": "start, but the total"
  },
  {
    "start": 340.06,
    "end": 340.84,
    "text": "needs context."
  },
  {
    "start": 341.3,
    "end": 341.9,
    "text": "Three of his league"
  },
  {
    "start": 341.9,
    "end": 342.9,
    "text": "goals were penalties."
  },
  {
    "start": 343.34,
    "end": 344.1,
    "text": "A scoring rate like"
  },
  {
    "start": 344.1,
    "end": 345.32,
    "text": "this should not be"
  },
  {
    "start": 345.32,
    "end": 346.6,
    "text": "stretched across an entire"
  },
  {
    "start": 346.6,
    "end": 347.8,
    "text": "season and treated as"
  },
  {
    "start": 347.8,
    "end": 348.24,
    "text": "a promise."
  },
  {
    "start": 348.84,
    "end": 350.6,
    "text": "The stronger argument is"
  },
  {
    "start": 350.6,
    "end": 351.52,
    "text": "the range of chances"
  },
  {
    "start": 351.52,
    "end": 352.66,
    "text": "this role can produce."
  },
  {
    "start": 353.14,
    "end": 353.72,
    "text": "You can have an"
  },
  {
    "start": 353.72,
    "end": 355.16,
    "text": "average finishing day and"
  },
  {
    "start": 355.16,
    "end": 356.02,
    "text": "still make the same"
  },
  {
    "start": 356.02,
    "end": 356.76,
    "text": "intelligent run."
  },
  {
    "start": 357.72,
    "end": 358.56,
